QoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["比較希望能吃到細麵，而且覺得麵較硬了點，350$就是如圖看到的這些東西，我已經不是點辣的了但湯還是太鹹無法喝完，我覺得也不需要問要不要清湯，可以直接附上就好了，要一些蛋什麼的還要另外單點，其實吃起來沒有到非常特別，雖然看過很多評價了但我還是想自己親自嚐試，是覺得真的比別人貴可是吃起來都差不多，因為我不吃辣，所以也不會有機會再去嚐試麻辣口味了。\n另外身後有掛衣服的地方很好但如果腳下有置物籃會更好，吃那麼貴的麵，包包還沒地方可以安心乾淨的放著，實在不會想去第二次了。",null,[0,172]]]],[],[null,null,1400,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SblIzWjVOM1J4TUZsMFlsWk5ibUpHV0VkMk5YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa2c54424c7bf3e82!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRnR3Z5N3RxMFl0YlZNbmJGWEd2NXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SblIzWjVOM1J4TUZsMFlsWk5ibUpHV0VkMk5YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SblIzWjVOM1J4TUZsMFlsWk5ibUpHV0VkMk5YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SblIzWjVOM1J4TUZsMFlsWk5ibUpHV0VkMk5YYxILMGVTaGdSWHRNTGkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uUm5SM1o1TjNSeE1GbDBZbFpOYm1KR1dFZDJOWGMSCzBlU2hnUlh0TUxpIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARgj6_xyRExaIqCzBlU2hnUlh0TUxp\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi03MHGsteWAxW1lK8BHakcCwgQoykIVigK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj-kcfGsteWAxWA7osBHc-7EjgQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi03MHGsteWAxW1lK8BHakcCwgQ0pMFCEUoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Nd09GUnVlbTlZTFVaQk5UUkNXVUpCYkZKemRFRRAB",["0x0:0xa2c54424c7bf3e82",null,1771568851801817,1771603032409025,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117930401803603736380/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["李秉鴻","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxRw8p5DmKLA0PIY0SVhl01_unU6a6d2SSKTi8iQvtXXdETiUN\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117930401803603736380?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"117930401803603736380",null,18,45,null,[1,5,1],0,["在地嚮導 · 18 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwi03MHGsteWAxW1lK8BHakcCwgQpr8GCFgoAA"]]]],null,"6 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,n